{"key":"enterprise/T1136.003","id":"T1136.003","name":"Cloud Account","domain":"enterprise","level":"subtechnique","parent_id":"T1136","tactics":["persistence"],"platforms":["IaaS","SaaS","Office Suite","Identity Provider"],"environments":["cloud","identity","onprem","saas"],"environment_basis":"project_taxonomy_from_upstream_platforms","summary":"Adversaries may create a cloud account to maintain access to victim systems. With a sufficient level of access, such accounts may be used to establish secondary credentialed access that does not require persistent remote access tools to be deployed on the system. In addition to user accounts, cloud accounts may be associated with services. Cloud providers handle the concept of service accounts in different ways. In Azure, service accounts…","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1136/003","source_stix_id":"attack-pattern--a009cb25-4801-4116-9105-80a91cf15c1b","source_modified":"2025-10-24T17:49:09.917Z","source_object_version":"1.6","telemetry":{"status":"mapped","components":[{"id":"DC0094","name":"Group Modification","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0094","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--05d5b5b4-ef93-4807-b05f-33d8c5a35bc5","page":"telemetry/DC0094/"},{"id":"DC0002","name":"User Account Authentication","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0002","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--a953ca55-921a-44f7-9b8d-3d40141aa17e","page":"telemetry/DC0002/"},{"id":"DC0014","name":"User Account Creation","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0014","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--deb22295-7e37-4a3b-ac6f-c86666fbe63d","page":"telemetry/DC0014/"},{"id":"DC0010","name":"User Account Modification","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0010","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--d27b0089-2c39-4b6c-84ff-303e48657e77","page":"telemetry/DC0010/"}],"strategies":[{"id":"DET0319","name":"Detection Strategy for T1136.003 - Cloud Account Creation across IaaS, IdP, SaaS, Office","url":"h